---
id: <feature>-verification
type: verify
role: <registered-role>
depends_on:
  - <feature>-implementation
context_mode: fresh
working_directory: .
timeout: 45m
engine:
  name: codex
  model: <approved-model>
  sandbox: workspace-write
acceptance_criteria:
  - <focused feature behaviour is verified>
  - <required component or repository gate is green>
allowed_paths:
  - <implementation-path>/**
  - <test-path>/**
  - docs/**
forbidden_paths:
  - <unrelated-surface>/**
validation:
  - <required-component-or-repository-gate>
  - git diff --check
---

# Verify <feature>

Read the shared specification and implementation handoff. Run the declared
gate. Fix only regressions within this slice's path policy; otherwise report
the exact blocker, command, and evidence. Update durable documentation when
the shared specification requires it.

STATUS: PASS|PARTIAL|BLOCKED
NEXT_PROMPT_SAFE: yes|no
